# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Mu - ignore rules
#
# Companion.ArchitectureChecks requires the exact lines marked "invariant"
# below to be present. Do not reword or move them.
#
# Nothing in this repository needs a credential: Mu reads no API key and
# contacts no cloud service. These rules exist so that credentials, private
# assistant memory and local user data stay local even if that changes.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- invariant: credentials and secrets ------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.dmp
*.pfx
*.key
*.p12
*.pem
*.jks
*.keystore
*.ovpn
secrets/
**/secrets/
.aws/
.azure/
.gcloud/
.netrc
credentials.json
service-account*.json
*_rsa
*_ed25519
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*

# --- invariant: private assistant memory and local user data ----------------
# Mu's runtime profile lives outside the repo at
# %LOCALAPPDATA%/DesktopCompanion. These rules also cover any in-repo profile
# created by scripts/verify*.ps1 or a stray --data-dir.
*.db
*.db-*
*.sqlite*
*.sqlite-journal
*.sqlite-wal
*.sqlite-shm
**/DesktopCompanion/
**/CompanionDev/
.ml-lab/
**/ml-lab/default-project/
**/default-project/
*.profile/
**/profile/
chat-history/
conversations/
memory/
assistant-memory/
saved-chats/
logs/
*.log

# --- build output and IDE state -------------------------------------------
**/bin/
**/obj/
.vs/
.idea/
.vscode/
*.user
*.suo
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
TestResults/
**/TestResults/
*.trx
*.coverage
coverage*.xml
coverage*.json
BenchmarkDotNet.Artifacts/

# --- workspace-local package caches (NuGet.Config redirects here) ---------
.dotnet-home/
.packages/
.nuget/
**/packages.lock.json.bak

# --- generated artifacts ---------------------------------------------------
# Compiled executables, QA evidence, rendered icons and measurement output.
artifacts/
**/artifacts/
**/out/
**/output/
*.tmp
*.bak
*.orig
*.rej
*.spec
dist/
build/

# --- optional Python worker environments and caches ------------------------
**/__pycache__/
**/.venv/
**/venv/
**/env/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.hypothesis/

# --- large model weights and datasets --------------------------------------
# The ML Lab and neural-speech worker download these at first run into
# artifacts/ and %LOCALAPPDATA%. They must never be committed.
*.safetensors
*.gguf
*.ckpt
*.pth
*.pt
*.onnx
*.npz
*.npy
*.parquet
*.arrow
*.pkl
*.joblib
*.tflite
*.h5
*.msgpack
*.bin
hf-cache/
huggingface/
.cache/
**/.cache/huggingface/
torch/
**/torch/

# --- OS noise --------------------------------------------------------------
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
*.lnk